# For dropping this template's rendering machinery on top of an existing
# repo (notes/, code/, algebra/, whatever it already tracks) without that
# repo tracking the machinery itself. sync_to_notes_repo.sh installs this
# as .gitignore in the destination.
#
# Everything already in the destination repo is left alone; only the
# specific files/dirs this template brings in are ignored below.

# Generated output this template produces when built in place.
/public/
/build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*~
.#*

# This template's own top-level files and directories.
# (README/docs, agent files, and references/ are not copied by
# sync_to_notes_repo.sh, so they are not listed here: the destination keeps
# its own README, AGENT, and bibliography. The CSL citation style ships under
# site/csl/ and is covered by the /site/ rule below.)
/build_site.py
/export-fragments.el
/export_tex.py
/justfile
/serve_site.py
/site/
/site.yml
/sync_to_notes_repo.sh
/.gitignore_alt
